==English==

===Etymology===
Origin unknown. Possibly derived from "tosheroon" (5 crowns), therefore something of minimal worth.

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|/tɒʃ/}}
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɒʃ|-ɒʃ]]

